{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Security Risk.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Security Risk.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"security risk security risk","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Security Risk.md","fileName":"Security Risk.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Security Risk","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-09 00:00\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Cloud Security Monitoring and Resilience]] [[Cyber Threat Vulnerability and Risk Analysis]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cloud Security Monitoring and Resilience","Cyber Threat Vulnerability and Risk Analysis","cloudcomputing_mit.epub","cybersecurity.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Security Risk.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Security Risk.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"security risk security risk","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Security Risk.md","fileName":"Security Risk.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Security Risk","heading":"Security Risk","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Security risk expresses the likelihood and consequence of a security breach in relation to a threat and the system's vulnerability to it. The book presents a simple quantitative view in which risk grows as either threat level or vulnerability level grows.\n\nA risk assessment helps prioritize controls rather than treating every possible event as equally urgent. The assessment must follow the data, users, systems, and providers across the complete cloud service boundary.\n\nThe source expresses a qualitative cyber-risk relationship as threat multiplied by vulnerability and impact. The values depend on context and expert judgment, but the structure forces an assessment to connect an exploitable weakness and potential actor with consequences for a particular asset.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cloud